Syntax: repair <item>

With the proper tools, a warrior has the ability to repair
his or her own equipment. The art of repairing is a tedious
and tiresome task, but it is a fundamental skill all warriors
should learn eventually.

The appropriate tools must be held and in the room and the item
you wish to repair must be in your inventory in order to repair
it.

Only metal equipment can be repaired using smythe.

Tools necessary:
     Primary:   hammer
     Secondary: tongs
     In-room:   forge
     In-room:   anvil

Smiths are also able to DEBRIDE rust from metal objects. Doing so requires the
blacksmith to hold a file in their primary hand. Removing rust from an item
will require a decent amount of time to complete, the amount is proportional
to how large the object is.